@startuml
actor User
participant "Your Site (Client)" as Client
participant "Microsoft (Auth Server)" as AuthServer
participant "Microsoft (Resource Server)" as Resource

User -> Client: Visit site, click 'Login with Microsoft'
Client -> AuthServer: Redirect to /authorize
User -> AuthServer: Enter credentials
AuthServer -> User: Authenticate user
AuthServer -> Client: Redirect back with code
Client -> AuthServer: Exchange code for tokens (/token)
AuthServer -> Client: Return access token, id token
Client -> Resource: Request user info (with access token)
Resource -> Client: Return user data (e.g., avatar)
Client -> User: Show authenticated UI
@enduml
